# SolarEPC-Pro Phase 4: Advanced EPC Modules

## Goal Description
Implement Modules 3, 5, 6, and 7 from the professional curriculum. This includes advanced cable sizing, detailed loss/thermal modeling, performance ratio analysis, and granular financial/degradation modeling.

## User Review Required
> [!IMPORTANT]
> **Cable Sizing**: We will use simplified IEC 60364-5-52 tables for ampacity (Current Carrying Capacity) assuming standard conditions (30°C ambient, in air).
> **Thermal Model**: We will explicitly calculate Cell Temp using the NOCT formula $T_{cell} = T_{amb} + \frac{G}{800}(NOCT - 20)$ for display purposes, while [pvlib](file:///C:/Users/samsung/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/SolarEPC-Pro/tests/test_phase2.py#9-16) handles the physics internally.

